{
  "info": {
    "_postman_id": "9c46c100-bf52-5fa9-be8f-402c9fa4d25c",
    "name": "Ch31 Response Time Checks",
    "description": "# Ch31 Response Time Checks\n\nResponse-time budgets as tests. The budgets are collection variables, so a pipeline can tighten or relax them without editing the tests:\n\n`newman run ... --env-var fastBudgetMs=300`\n\nThe slow request uses `/api/slow?ms={{slowMs}}`: change `slowMs` to see the budget test fail.",
    "schema": "https://schema.getpostman.com/json/collection/v2.1.0/collection.json"
  },
  "item": [
    {
      "name": "Product details within the fast budget",
      "event": [
        {
          "listen": "test",
          "script": {
            "type": "text/javascript",
            "exec": [
              "const budget = Number(pm.variables.get('fastBudgetMs'));",
              "pm.test(`Product details answered in under ${budget} ms`, () => {",
              "  pm.expect(pm.response.responseTime).to.be.below(budget);",
              "});"
            ]
          }
        }
      ],
      "request": {
        "method": "GET",
        "header": [],
        "url": {
          "raw": "{{baseUrl}}/api/products/1",
          "host": [
            "{{baseUrl}}"
          ],
          "path": [
            "api",
            "products",
            "1"
          ]
        }
      }
    },
    {
      "name": "Slow report within the slow budget",
      "event": [
        {
          "listen": "test",
          "script": {
            "type": "text/javascript",
            "exec": [
              "const budget = Number(pm.variables.get('slowBudgetMs'));",
              "pm.test(`Slow report answered in under ${budget} ms`, () => {",
              "  pm.expect(pm.response.responseTime).to.be.below(budget);",
              "});",
              "pm.test('The delay really happened (the test is measuring something)', () => {",
              "  const asked = Number(pm.variables.get('slowMs'));",
              "  pm.expect(pm.response.responseTime).to.be.at.least(asked);",
              "});"
            ]
          }
        }
      ],
      "request": {
        "method": "GET",
        "header": [],
        "url": {
          "raw": "{{baseUrl}}/api/slow?ms={{slowMs}}",
          "host": [
            "{{baseUrl}}"
          ],
          "path": [
            "api",
            "slow"
          ],
          "query": [
            {
              "key": "ms",
              "value": "{{slowMs}}"
            }
          ]
        }
      }
    }
  ],
  "variable": [
    {
      "key": "fastBudgetMs",
      "value": "500",
      "type": "string"
    },
    {
      "key": "slowBudgetMs",
      "value": "1000",
      "type": "string"
    },
    {
      "key": "slowMs",
      "value": "300",
      "type": "string"
    }
  ]
}
